WEBVTT

01:30.600 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:42.080 --> 01:43.320
You reported to Elder Cang

01:43.400 --> 01:45.840
that you're unwell
and unable to greet the guests?

01:45.920 --> 01:47.840
A troubled heart is still an illness.

01:47.920 --> 01:49.600
Greeting the Immortal Alliance members

01:49.680 --> 01:51.040
gets on my nerves.

01:51.640 --> 01:53.000
Isn't that also being unwell?

01:54.120 --> 01:55.320
That makes sense.

01:58.840 --> 02:01.560
Then why are you here to observe?

02:01.640 --> 02:02.720
Knowing the enemy well

02:03.320 --> 02:04.160
ensures victory.

02:06.160 --> 02:07.880
You're still this cautious, even now?

02:08.560 --> 02:09.840
I'm a spirit cultivating
demonic power, after all.

02:09.919 --> 02:13.080
I can't expect them
to show me any sympathy.

02:13.960 --> 02:16.080
What about you? Why aren't you
going to the Hall of Integrity?

02:16.800 --> 02:19.360
I'm not part of the Immortal Alliance.
No need to join the crowd.

02:23.600 --> 02:24.600
They're here.

02:28.520 --> 02:31.400
Welcome, Saint Fajian and Saint Yinian
from the Xuantian Sect.

02:34.960 --> 02:36.080
Please.

02:39.400 --> 02:41.640
I've heard that the Xuantian Sect
values tough practice,

02:41.720 --> 02:43.480
steadfast resolve,

02:44.320 --> 02:46.760
and techniques to dispel inner demons,

02:46.840 --> 02:47.680
specializing in countering the Dark Clan.

02:49.000 --> 02:49.960
Do you think

02:50.480 --> 02:52.320
they'll notice the demonic energy in me?

02:53.080 --> 02:55.280
With the runes
I've painted on you with spirit ink,

02:55.360 --> 02:57.520
it won't be detected
under normal circumstances.

02:59.000 --> 03:00.240
What about unusual circumstances?

03:02.640 --> 03:03.720
Then it depends

03:04.400 --> 03:05.600
on your luck.

03:09.920 --> 03:11.600
But compared to the Xuantian Sect,

03:12.360 --> 03:13.280
she's the last person I want to see.

03:17.320 --> 03:19.880
Welcome, Madam Su of the Mirage Palace.

03:22.640 --> 03:23.680
Please.

03:25.960 --> 03:27.480
As expected,

03:27.560 --> 03:28.680
enemies are bound to cross paths.

03:30.960 --> 03:32.480
Back at the Moonlight Heights,

03:33.720 --> 03:35.200
you and Miss Gao had a conflict.

03:44.240 --> 03:46.120
MOONLIGHT HEIGHTS

03:46.200 --> 03:49.320
Bad news!
Sang Qi's army is attacking. Run!

03:52.160 --> 03:54.480
Quick, switch
the young lady's clothes with hers!

03:56.200 --> 03:57.920
The young lady is of noble birth.

03:58.000 --> 03:59.160
Dying in her place

03:59.240 --> 04:01.600
is the greatest honor
a lowly servant like you could ever have!

04:03.160 --> 04:05.400
Just some old stories about
wicked masters and their servants.

04:06.080 --> 04:08.600
Mr. Nan, you're pure and untainted.

04:09.200 --> 04:10.960
No need to listen to such filth.

04:13.920 --> 04:15.280
From our first meeting,

04:15.360 --> 04:16.760
I caught a glimpse

04:18.200 --> 04:19.920
of how hard your past

04:21.160 --> 04:22.520
-must've been.
-Enough.

04:22.600 --> 04:23.880
No need to pity me.

04:24.520 --> 04:25.480
It's unnecessary.

04:26.480 --> 04:28.280
I didn't intend to pity you.

04:30.560 --> 04:33.200
If you aren't beaten down, stand back up

04:34.560 --> 04:36.040
and take everything back.

04:38.200 --> 04:40.760
That's how it should be in this world.

04:44.520 --> 04:45.840
-Elder Cang.
-Master He.

04:46.440 --> 04:48.160
Since we last met on the Osprey Island,

04:48.240 --> 04:50.080
you still look as distinguished
as ever, Master He.

04:50.920 --> 04:53.200
-Elder Cang, I trust you've been well.
-Please.

04:55.040 --> 04:57.160
Master He Xianwo of the Osprey Island

04:57.760 --> 05:00.040
seems like a carefree person.

05:00.760 --> 05:02.480
I hear he loves adopting spirit beasts.

05:03.640 --> 05:05.600
Wouldn't he clash with Su Ningzhen

05:06.240 --> 05:07.160
if they met?

05:07.760 --> 05:08.880
In fact,

05:09.600 --> 05:10.600
they're already at odds.

05:11.440 --> 05:12.280
That's just perfect.

05:13.240 --> 05:14.280
Su Ningzhen

05:14.880 --> 05:15.920
is just so annoying.

05:16.000 --> 05:17.920
Someone really ought to deal with her.

05:29.520 --> 05:31.920
The Cloud Floating Airships
of the Jade Sky Palace

05:32.000 --> 05:33.840
get more luxurious with each one.

05:41.520 --> 05:42.760
Master Fu, Elder Duan,

05:42.840 --> 05:45.200
your arrival graces us!

05:45.920 --> 05:46.920
Please.

05:47.760 --> 05:48.800
How do you think

05:48.880 --> 05:50.640
Fu Yuanting and Duan Xiaorong

05:51.240 --> 05:52.760
managed to find such a goldmine?

05:52.840 --> 05:54.240
-This way, please.
-Look at that guy,

05:55.040 --> 05:57.360
Every single thing he's wearing

05:57.440 --> 05:59.120
is a Celestial Artifact

05:59.200 --> 06:00.160
or an extremely rare treasure.

06:00.240 --> 06:02.000
Walking around like that,

06:02.080 --> 06:04.240
who wouldn't want to rob him?

06:04.840 --> 06:06.680
He is the Young Master
of the Jade Sky Palace,

06:06.760 --> 06:07.840
Fu Lansheng.

06:10.760 --> 06:11.600
Mother!

06:13.240 --> 06:14.320
I'm going out to play.

06:16.000 --> 06:17.040
Go ahead.

06:17.680 --> 06:19.320
He's earned another title
as the greatest in the world.

06:19.400 --> 06:20.640
Nan Xuyue!

06:21.160 --> 06:22.520
Mr. Fu.

06:23.120 --> 06:24.640
I heard you came to the Snow City too,

06:24.720 --> 06:26.040
so I followed them along.

06:27.720 --> 06:30.120
The beauty beside you is unfamiliar.

06:30.880 --> 06:33.040
She's a new disciple in the Snow City,
Mu Xuanling.

06:33.120 --> 06:33.960
This is Young Master Fu.

06:34.840 --> 06:35.880
Greetings, Miss Mu.

06:37.960 --> 06:40.120
For a moment, I thought she was Miss Gao.

06:41.880 --> 06:43.840
Who is the Miss Gao

06:43.920 --> 06:45.160
you mentioned?

06:45.240 --> 06:46.840
The rumored most beautiful lady
of the Immortal Alliance,

06:46.920 --> 06:48.320
Gao Qiumin from the Mirage Palace.

06:48.400 --> 06:49.600
It's hard to imagine

06:49.680 --> 06:50.920
she could outshine your beauty.

06:56.160 --> 06:58.320
Both are beautiful, just different styles.

07:03.160 --> 07:04.360
Are you

07:04.440 --> 07:06.160
also a cultivator?

07:06.240 --> 07:07.440
Of course!

07:07.520 --> 07:08.760
Can't you tell?

07:09.520 --> 07:10.600
I'm already at the Golden Core level.

07:11.480 --> 07:12.440
If you run into any trouble,

07:12.520 --> 07:13.640
you can always count on me to help.

07:13.720 --> 07:15.520
A friend of Nan Xuyue's

07:15.600 --> 07:16.600
is my friend too.

07:17.680 --> 07:19.800
Since it's our first meeting,
I didn't prepare any gifts.

07:24.360 --> 07:27.440
But here are some artifacts
I recently collected,

07:28.040 --> 07:29.560
all suited for women.

07:29.640 --> 07:31.040
Do you like them?

07:33.760 --> 07:36.560
These are all Celestial Artifacts!

07:36.640 --> 07:38.120
That's nothing.

07:38.200 --> 07:39.040
I have plenty more at home.

07:40.120 --> 07:41.120
The Jade Sky Palace

07:41.640 --> 07:42.720
is unmatched in wealth.

07:42.800 --> 07:44.880
Young Master Fu
is the richest man in the world.

07:45.640 --> 07:47.760
Since he insists on giving them to you,
accept them.

07:50.360 --> 07:51.400
Please accept them.

07:55.120 --> 07:56.160
Father!

07:58.560 --> 07:59.840
What's that sound?

07:59.920 --> 08:01.600
-Father!
-What's that sound?

08:02.920 --> 08:04.640
It's… from my spirit beast.

08:05.800 --> 08:07.680
What kind of spirit beast
calls out "Father"?

08:09.280 --> 08:10.720
Are you my father?

08:11.360 --> 08:12.560
Come out!

08:13.200 --> 08:14.240
Let her come out.

08:19.760 --> 08:20.880
Come out.

08:27.600 --> 08:28.960
Father!

08:32.000 --> 08:33.200
Are you my father?

08:35.159 --> 08:37.520
She… She lost her father.

08:41.440 --> 08:42.679
I think

08:42.760 --> 08:44.600
it's quite clear

08:45.200 --> 08:46.160
that I'm human.

08:48.240 --> 08:50.840
My mother said my father
is the richest cultivator in the world.

08:51.920 --> 08:53.840
But my money comes from my parents.

08:55.160 --> 08:56.320
That means

08:56.960 --> 08:59.600
the richest cultivator in the world
must be my father.

09:01.040 --> 09:01.880
Brother!

09:03.000 --> 09:04.440
Plenty of people call me "brother",

09:05.040 --> 09:07.240
but yours is the sweetest. Come,

09:07.800 --> 09:09.400
I will give you a gift.

09:10.080 --> 09:11.600
These are all artifacts
suitable for the Spirit Clan.

09:12.840 --> 09:14.200
How do you have artifacts
for the Spirit Clan?

09:14.800 --> 09:15.840
My family has 3,000 Spirit Clan members.

09:16.680 --> 09:19.080
-You mean you have 3,000 spirit slaves?
-No.

09:19.680 --> 09:21.800
To me, they're all very good friends,

09:22.560 --> 09:23.800
and we often play together.

09:24.680 --> 09:27.000
Little one, what's your father's name?

09:27.840 --> 09:28.840
I'll help you look
into it when I get back.

09:28.920 --> 09:30.080
Fu Cangli.

09:31.520 --> 09:32.400
Fu Cangli…

09:33.160 --> 09:35.280
That name does sound like someone
from the Jade Sky Palace.

09:36.000 --> 09:37.040
I'll keep an eye out.

09:38.240 --> 09:39.600
Then I'll take my leave.

09:39.680 --> 09:40.680
To both of you…

09:41.920 --> 09:42.960
To all three of you,

09:43.600 --> 09:44.680
farewell.

09:44.760 --> 09:45.640
No need to see me out.

09:47.720 --> 09:48.960
I get it now.

09:49.520 --> 09:51.040
You were saying earlier

09:51.120 --> 09:53.280
that he's the world's biggest dupe,

09:54.880 --> 09:55.840
right?

09:57.280 --> 09:59.240
UPRIGHTNESS PALACE

10:10.960 --> 10:12.000
Excuse me.

10:13.520 --> 10:15.760
The Sect Leaders
are inside discussing matters.

10:19.000 --> 10:20.000
Thank you.

10:41.880 --> 10:42.800
It seems

10:43.320 --> 10:45.280
she must be the renowned Miss Gao.

10:46.000 --> 10:47.640
Such elegance

10:47.720 --> 10:48.640
and such grace.

10:49.360 --> 10:50.480
Even compared to Miss Mu,

10:50.560 --> 10:51.880
there's not much difference.

10:52.760 --> 10:55.160
So quiet and composed,

10:55.240 --> 10:58.120
truly a perfect match for Mr. Xie.

11:03.000 --> 11:04.520
Why does he keep staring at me?

11:05.360 --> 11:07.480
Seeing a beauty
shouldn't warrant such exaggeration.

11:13.720 --> 11:15.560
Forget it. While traveling,

11:15.640 --> 11:17.840
I represent the Mirage Palace.
I won't lower myself to his level.

11:19.680 --> 11:20.640
Truly refined,

11:21.160 --> 11:23.760
the very image of a Young Lord's wife.

11:27.480 --> 11:28.560
Mr. Xie,

11:29.440 --> 11:30.560
may I ask

11:30.640 --> 11:32.480
why you've gathered us

11:32.560 --> 11:33.960
here in the Snow City?

11:35.160 --> 11:36.280
And where is the Alliance Leader?

11:42.280 --> 11:43.360
Seniors,

11:45.840 --> 11:47.040
the Snow City is in distress.

11:48.840 --> 11:50.000
The Alliance Leader…

11:51.400 --> 11:52.240
has been assassinated.

11:53.160 --> 11:54.000
How could this happen?

11:54.960 --> 11:56.200
Who is behind this?

11:56.720 --> 11:58.840
It must have been Sang Qi
and the Decaying Immortal Pavilion.

12:00.320 --> 12:01.480
The Decaying Immortal Pavilion?

12:02.240 --> 12:03.680
The Decaying Immortal Pavilion
conspired with Sang Qi.

12:04.400 --> 12:06.680
They once stole
the Mirage Palace's jade token,

12:07.400 --> 12:09.000
causing the Alliance Leader's death.

12:09.600 --> 12:11.360
Their goal is to seize
all the jade tokens.

12:11.960 --> 12:13.320
Has anyone here noticed

12:14.280 --> 12:15.680
anything unusual in your sects recently?

12:23.800 --> 12:25.600
No unusual activity has been detected.

12:26.880 --> 12:27.880
May I ask,

12:27.960 --> 12:30.080
where is the jade token
of the Snow City now?

12:32.360 --> 12:33.560
The enemy didn't succeed.

12:34.160 --> 12:35.720
The jade token remains in the Snow City.

12:36.760 --> 12:38.120
I've always said

12:38.200 --> 12:39.560
we should attack the Dark Abyss first

12:40.160 --> 12:41.680
and kill those filthy creatures.

12:43.120 --> 12:45.320
The Dark Clan is immortal.

12:45.960 --> 12:49.000
Charging in recklessly
will not guarantee victory.

12:49.080 --> 12:51.800
That's true. We must proceed cautiously.

12:51.880 --> 12:53.640
If the Immortal Alliance
suffers too many losses,

12:53.720 --> 12:54.800
it would not be worth it.

12:58.200 --> 12:59.840
Sang Qi's return this time

13:00.360 --> 13:02.320
is to seize the Chaos Pearl

13:03.280 --> 13:04.840
and unlock the barrier
of the Immortals Array.

13:05.640 --> 13:07.000
The most pressing matter now

13:08.320 --> 13:09.560
is to elect a new Alliance Leader

13:10.720 --> 13:11.560
and entrust him

13:12.720 --> 13:14.320
with safeguarding the Chaos Pearl.

13:16.440 --> 13:17.520
Mr. Xie.

13:18.960 --> 13:20.240
Mr. Xie,

13:20.320 --> 13:22.280
you are recognized as the brightest star
of the Immortal Alliance.

13:23.040 --> 13:25.360
I believe you're capable
of taking on this responsibility.

13:26.240 --> 13:27.320
I was ambushed at Two Realms Mountain

13:27.920 --> 13:29.160
while repairing the Immortals Array,

13:30.240 --> 13:32.600
trapped in the Lava for seven days.
My injuries were serious,

13:33.680 --> 13:35.240
and my spiritual power has yet to recover.

13:36.320 --> 13:37.760
Given the urgent situation,

13:38.840 --> 13:40.160
I'm afraid I cannot take on this role.

13:42.880 --> 13:44.760
All it takes is your word,

13:44.840 --> 13:45.840
and the Jade Sky Palace

13:45.920 --> 13:48.520
will immediately hire
the world's best healers to heal you.

13:49.120 --> 13:52.640
Additionally, the Jade Sky Palace
has the most secure vault in existence.

13:52.720 --> 13:54.120
We can safeguard the Chaos Pearl.

13:54.200 --> 13:56.720
The situation is urgent now.
There's no time for delay.

13:57.360 --> 14:01.760
Besides, when has the Jade Sky Palace
ever cared about the Alliance's affairs?

14:02.520 --> 14:03.360
Su Ningzhen,

14:03.440 --> 14:05.280
if you intend to fight
for the Alliance Leader position,

14:05.360 --> 14:06.760
just say it directly.

14:06.840 --> 14:09.120
Why bother mocking
the Jade Sky Palace here?

14:09.720 --> 14:10.560
Fine, I'll say it directly.

14:11.680 --> 14:13.560
All this time, it's been the Mirage Palace

14:13.640 --> 14:16.760
guarding the Two Realms Mountain pass
and fending off invaders.

14:19.440 --> 14:20.760
And the only one to lose a token

14:21.600 --> 14:23.000
was also the Mirage Palace.

14:23.680 --> 14:25.080
If you became the Alliance Leader,

14:25.680 --> 14:27.680
how would you protect anything at all?

14:28.280 --> 14:29.320
He Xianwo,

14:29.400 --> 14:30.600
you spend all day with the Spirit Clan.

14:30.680 --> 14:32.160
Perhaps you've already forgotten
who you are!

14:45.600 --> 14:46.880
Sir, Madam, there's no need for this.

14:46.960 --> 14:48.000
Calm down.

14:53.520 --> 14:54.520
The path of faith is compassionate!

15:07.240 --> 15:08.160
Saint Fajian,

15:08.240 --> 15:09.600
he offended the Mirage Palace first.

15:09.680 --> 15:10.880
I had no choice but to act.

15:12.800 --> 15:14.960
Since Saint Fajian has spoken,

15:15.480 --> 15:18.440
I'll stop speaking too bluntly.

15:26.760 --> 15:28.280
Six thousand years ago,

15:28.360 --> 15:30.640
our predecessor, Lord Qian Guang,
established the Immortal Alliance

15:30.720 --> 15:32.480
to mend divisions

15:32.560 --> 15:34.040
and unite against external threats.

15:35.200 --> 15:37.280
Now, with Leader Xie's death still fresh,

15:37.360 --> 15:39.320
and the enemy still hidden in shadows,

15:40.080 --> 15:42.440
you're already falling apart?

15:54.320 --> 15:56.000
It seems there'll be no conclusion today.

15:56.600 --> 15:57.880
For the next few days,

15:58.640 --> 16:00.280
please consider the candidates
for Alliance Leader

16:00.960 --> 16:02.200
while staying in the city.

16:04.760 --> 16:06.360
We'll set another day
to hold the election.

16:19.720 --> 16:21.040
Within the Immortal Alliance,

16:22.120 --> 16:24.280
I was closest to Daocheng.

16:24.960 --> 16:26.760
Now that he's gone,

16:26.840 --> 16:28.960
I've lost a drinking companion too.

16:29.720 --> 16:30.960
I suppose

16:31.520 --> 16:33.600
Xuechen has his doubts,

16:34.400 --> 16:36.160
which is why he hasn't said anything

16:36.840 --> 16:38.800
and has summoned us all here.

16:39.600 --> 16:42.040
Among the suspects in Mr. Xie's eyes,

16:42.720 --> 16:43.880
you're naturally included as well.

16:45.840 --> 16:46.960
Now that he's the city lord,

16:47.560 --> 16:49.080
he can't trust anyone.

16:49.640 --> 16:50.640
That's exactly as it should be.

16:52.320 --> 16:54.440
If Daocheng saw this,

16:55.040 --> 16:56.080
he would be comforted.

16:56.800 --> 16:59.680
Then why don't you fight
for the Alliance Leader position?

17:00.600 --> 17:01.760
Why let Su Ningzhen

17:02.440 --> 17:03.480
act so arrogantly?

17:07.079 --> 17:09.880
Why bother fighting
for such a burdensome position?

17:10.839 --> 17:12.319
I live far away on the Osprey Island

17:12.839 --> 17:15.400
precisely because I don't want
to be troubled by such trivial matters.

17:16.680 --> 17:18.359
Fighting for it just to deal
with Su Ningzhen

17:19.480 --> 17:20.319
isn't worth it.

17:25.319 --> 17:26.400
This way, please.

17:34.720 --> 17:38.000
HALL OF SAINTS

17:42.800 --> 17:44.280
Madam Su, you and your cultivators

17:44.360 --> 17:45.720
can rest in this courtyard.

17:47.280 --> 17:48.240
Please.

17:51.000 --> 17:52.040
This way, please.

18:04.200 --> 18:05.240
Qiumin.

18:08.640 --> 18:09.560
Madam.

18:10.760 --> 18:11.640
What are you daydreaming about?

18:13.040 --> 18:15.240
I… I just didn't expect

18:15.320 --> 18:16.960
that Leader Xie would be murdered.

18:18.120 --> 18:20.200
So much has happened recently.

18:21.480 --> 18:23.720
As the Young Madam of the Mirage Palace,

18:23.800 --> 18:25.000
how can you be so timid?

18:26.520 --> 18:27.600
Qiumin,

18:27.680 --> 18:29.480
you need to cultivate not only your skills

18:29.560 --> 18:30.880
but also your mind.

18:33.560 --> 18:35.160
Understood, Madam.

18:38.520 --> 18:40.360
When I become the Alliance Leader,

18:41.440 --> 18:44.160
you must be prepared
to take over the Mirage Palace.

19:12.600 --> 19:13.640
If someone didn't know better,

19:14.240 --> 19:15.920
they'd think
the Immortal Alliance is falling apart.

19:16.960 --> 19:18.400
Back when my father was around,

19:19.440 --> 19:21.360
I barely paid attention
to the Alliance's matters.

19:22.120 --> 19:23.360
Now that I've seen it,

19:24.480 --> 19:26.040
I realize even the Alliance

19:26.720 --> 19:28.400
can be this ridiculous.

19:30.040 --> 19:31.200
You didn't join the Alliance

19:31.800 --> 19:33.160
because of this reason too, didn't you?

19:34.680 --> 19:36.760
That's the difference between us.

19:38.360 --> 19:39.840
For things I hate,

19:40.360 --> 19:42.200
I can turn a blind eye.

19:42.800 --> 19:43.800
But you,

19:44.840 --> 19:46.080
you can't help but try to fix them.

19:48.560 --> 19:51.360
That's why I can live carefree
at the Greenview Heights,

19:52.000 --> 19:53.960
while you're left in the bitter cold,

19:54.040 --> 19:56.000
bound and alone.

20:08.120 --> 20:09.240
Leader Xie

20:09.760 --> 20:11.080
was at the Spiritual Form stage.

20:12.120 --> 20:13.400
Whoever killed him

20:13.920 --> 20:15.440
must be among them.

20:18.520 --> 20:20.680
You're pretending
your spiritual power hasn't recovered

20:20.760 --> 20:21.880
to lure the traitor out,

20:22.680 --> 20:24.120
but they might not fall for it.

20:25.000 --> 20:26.320
Within a few days,

20:27.480 --> 20:29.040
there will likely be
an assassination attempt.

20:30.200 --> 20:31.360
I'm waiting for them.

20:34.440 --> 20:37.720
When will you start
worrying about your own life?

20:46.800 --> 20:48.640
If you die,

20:51.680 --> 20:53.400
I might actually…

20:55.040 --> 20:56.080
feel a little sad.

21:02.680 --> 21:03.720
I'll try not to die.

21:09.280 --> 21:10.360
Senior.

21:10.440 --> 21:11.320
Senior!

21:11.880 --> 21:13.240
What are your thoughts on this matter?

21:13.840 --> 21:15.120
You should have…

21:17.600 --> 21:18.760
Senior,

21:18.840 --> 21:20.480
even if it's for the people of this world,

21:20.560 --> 21:22.400
you should take up
the role of Alliance Leader.

21:23.400 --> 21:24.440
When it comes to resolve,

21:24.960 --> 21:26.160
I am not as strong as Mr. Xie.

21:27.120 --> 21:28.760
When it comes to cultivation stage,

21:28.840 --> 21:29.920
I am far weaker.

21:30.000 --> 21:32.760
How can you know that
without fighting him?

21:33.440 --> 21:35.840
Mr. Xie may be born with an extra sense,

21:35.920 --> 21:37.040
but he's still so young.

21:37.120 --> 21:39.920
Can he really compare to you,
with 500 years of cultivation?

21:40.000 --> 21:42.000
Mr. Xie's faith is pure,

21:42.080 --> 21:42.920
and his sword heart untainted.

21:43.520 --> 21:45.880
But I… My heart
is filled with distractions.

21:46.960 --> 21:47.800
I am unworthy of the position.

21:50.240 --> 21:51.400
-Senior…
-Master,

21:52.160 --> 21:53.120
the Sect Leader is tired.

21:53.720 --> 21:54.640
Please let him rest for now.

22:03.520 --> 22:05.960
Xuan Xin, you call me Master,

22:06.040 --> 22:08.520
yet you always side with the Sect Leader.

22:08.600 --> 22:10.840
You shouldn't hold me back.
You should persuade him.

22:12.440 --> 22:14.040
The Sect Leader has his own decisions.

22:14.640 --> 22:16.800
No one should impose their will on him.

22:16.880 --> 22:18.120
No one?

22:18.200 --> 22:19.200
Are you saying I, your Master, am no one?

22:19.800 --> 22:20.960
Yes.

22:21.040 --> 22:22.480
-I am no one, too.
-You…

22:25.440 --> 22:27.320
I should never have
picked you up back then.

22:27.400 --> 22:29.000
Look at how you anger me now.

22:30.880 --> 22:34.200
What's done is done.

22:34.880 --> 22:35.800
Master,

22:36.400 --> 22:37.760
it's too late for regrets.

22:46.960 --> 22:49.160
I originally came here to have fun,

22:49.240 --> 22:51.240
but I didn't expect
the Alliance Leader to be killed.

22:51.840 --> 22:53.880
These scoundrels are truly bold,

22:53.960 --> 22:55.080
daring to act in the Snow City.

22:55.840 --> 22:57.840
-If I catch them, I'll definitely--
-What if you get harmed?

22:58.360 --> 23:01.040
This is not your battle to play hero.

23:01.640 --> 23:02.840
Before you reach the Spiritual Form stage,

23:02.920 --> 23:04.600
make sure you keep yourself alive.

23:05.200 --> 23:07.560
Your battlefield is a century from now.

23:07.640 --> 23:10.200
You're destined to become
the leader of the Immortal Alliance.

23:10.800 --> 23:12.920
Mother, aren't you thinking
too highly of me?

23:13.920 --> 23:15.160
What am I, really?

23:15.760 --> 23:17.400
Mr. Xie's divine presence

23:17.480 --> 23:18.400
and unparalleled sword skills

23:18.480 --> 23:20.880
are unmatched for centuries.

23:20.960 --> 23:22.600
Even if he isn't
the current Alliance Leader,

23:22.680 --> 23:23.760
he's bound to be the next.

23:24.560 --> 23:26.440
And besides, he's still so young.

23:26.520 --> 23:28.520
He could hold the position
for hundreds of years.

23:28.600 --> 23:29.760
What do you know?

23:30.360 --> 23:33.400
The Spiritual Form stage
grants a lifespan of a thousand years,

23:33.480 --> 23:35.520
but how many truly live to the end of it?

23:36.120 --> 23:37.920
And as for Xie Xuechen's sword skills,

23:38.520 --> 23:39.760
they're a force of pure devastation.

23:39.840 --> 23:43.040
"If I can't survive,
we all perish together…"

23:43.120 --> 23:45.040
They leave no path of retreat.

23:45.640 --> 23:48.720
That's not sustainable.

23:50.320 --> 23:51.280
Who knows?

23:51.360 --> 23:53.640
If you just live long enough,

23:53.720 --> 23:54.880
you won't even need to fight for it.

23:54.960 --> 23:57.680
You could simply outlast
all your opponents.

23:57.760 --> 23:58.840
Are you implying

23:59.560 --> 24:01.400
my greatest value is simply staying alive?

24:03.400 --> 24:04.320
I can't agree with that.

24:05.120 --> 24:06.800
Father's ideas make more sense.

24:08.600 --> 24:09.440
Lansheng,

24:10.280 --> 24:13.680
your greatest value is marrying someone
with power and influence,

24:13.760 --> 24:15.560
a Young Mistress who can hold her ground.

24:15.640 --> 24:18.840
That way, the Jade Sky Palace
can continue to thrive.

24:19.680 --> 24:20.960
-Father…
-Fu Yuanting!

24:22.440 --> 24:25.440
Your tricks might work on me,

24:25.520 --> 24:27.160
but now you're trying
to corrupt my son too?

24:27.240 --> 24:28.360
My tricks?

24:29.160 --> 24:31.520
Hey, didn't you pick me

24:31.600 --> 24:33.600
because you wanted
a son unmatched in looks,

24:33.680 --> 24:35.000
and I had

24:35.080 --> 24:36.840
an unparalleled, stunning face?

24:37.600 --> 24:39.080
We're on the same level.

24:39.160 --> 24:40.440
Neither of us has the right to criticize.

24:40.520 --> 24:43.840
But if I'd known your beauty would fade

24:43.920 --> 24:45.240
so quickly,

24:46.520 --> 24:47.880
I might have chosen someone else.

24:52.240 --> 24:53.360
There it is.

24:54.000 --> 24:55.440
You've finally admitted it.

24:55.520 --> 24:57.480
You're still thinking
about that person, right?

24:57.560 --> 24:59.080
Who? Who else could I have in mind?

24:59.160 --> 25:00.640
And what does it matter to you?

25:00.720 --> 25:02.240
I'm about to be betrayed by my wife!

25:02.320 --> 25:03.280
Of course it matters to me…

25:04.080 --> 25:06.120
Father, Mother, I'm still here.

25:06.760 --> 25:07.840
Get out!

25:14.120 --> 25:15.200
Oh…

25:15.720 --> 25:17.200
Young Master, what happened?

25:20.640 --> 25:21.600
I found a top-grade Hetian jade.

25:22.960 --> 25:24.040
Well,

25:24.960 --> 25:27.360
the Master and the Elders
are currently planning

25:27.440 --> 25:29.360
the future development
of the Jade Sky Palace.

25:29.960 --> 25:31.120
So, uh,

25:31.200 --> 25:33.040
carry on with your business. No worries.

25:45.000 --> 25:46.760
It's shocking how difficult

25:47.360 --> 25:49.000
marriage can be.

25:50.760 --> 25:51.960
Marriage?

25:53.360 --> 25:54.440
Only a fool would get married.

25:59.120 --> 26:02.720
SWIRLING SNOW PAVILION

26:02.800 --> 26:07.320
SWIRLING SNOW PAVILION

26:46.880 --> 26:47.760
This person isn't at
the Spiritual Form stage.

26:48.440 --> 26:51.040
With his strength, there's no way
he could have killed Father.

26:51.120 --> 26:52.680
It seems the real culprit

26:52.760 --> 26:53.920
is still in the shadows.

26:54.000 --> 26:54.920
As expected of Xie Xuechen.

26:55.000 --> 26:55.840
Even without drawing his sword,

26:55.920 --> 26:57.120
and with only 40%
of his usual spiritual power,

26:57.200 --> 26:58.360
he's still beyond the reach
of ordinary cultivators.

27:18.320 --> 27:19.480
In the dead of night,

27:19.560 --> 27:20.920
you two were really going at it.

27:21.520 --> 27:22.760
Even the bed broke.

27:25.480 --> 27:26.800
Your friend?

27:26.880 --> 27:27.960
He looks so terrifying.

27:38.160 --> 27:39.640
-You…
-No need to chase him.

27:40.320 --> 27:41.560
Let him go back and report.

27:48.680 --> 27:50.640
So, this was your and Nan Xuyue's plan,

27:51.280 --> 27:52.440
playing weak to lure the enemy?

27:54.320 --> 27:55.520
How despicable.

27:58.280 --> 28:00.120
You really should include me

28:00.200 --> 28:01.480
in such schemes.

28:02.080 --> 28:03.200
You? Forget it.

28:03.800 --> 28:05.200
This kind of underhanded tactic

28:05.760 --> 28:07.400
is far too fitting for you.

28:08.160 --> 28:09.760
Back here, in the Snow City,

28:09.840 --> 28:10.920
in your own home,

28:11.000 --> 28:12.480
and yet you still face killing attempts.

28:12.560 --> 28:15.200
So, how was it?
Good thing I arrived just in time, right?

28:16.520 --> 28:18.560
The Snow City token
isn't in their hands yet,

28:18.640 --> 28:20.520
so they won't kill me for now.

28:20.600 --> 28:23.240
They're just here to test how much
of my spiritual power has recovered.

28:23.320 --> 28:25.280
Then I overstepped.

28:26.760 --> 28:28.400
If I hadn't come earlier,

28:28.480 --> 28:29.920
how were you planning to end

28:30.000 --> 28:31.560
this drama?

28:31.640 --> 28:33.840
According to the plan, I'd get injured

28:34.400 --> 28:36.240
and desperately send out a distress call.

28:36.760 --> 28:39.240
The elders and disciples
would come to drive him away.

28:40.520 --> 28:42.280
Always with these reckless strategies.

28:44.640 --> 28:45.960
What about the sword I gave you?

28:46.680 --> 28:48.280
Didn't you say you wanted
to live like a mortal?

28:48.360 --> 28:49.680
Why are you still carrying
the demonic vines?

28:51.080 --> 28:52.480
Mr. Xie,

28:52.560 --> 28:54.480
my sword skills are awful.

28:54.560 --> 28:56.240
If I had brought a sword to save you,

28:56.320 --> 28:58.200
the assassin would have
laughed himself to death.

28:58.760 --> 28:59.640
Also,

29:00.160 --> 29:02.400
aren't you jumping
into this scolding too fast?

29:02.960 --> 29:04.120
Then I should thank you.

29:09.680 --> 29:11.080
Once I do, can I scold you?

29:11.160 --> 29:13.360
Late at night,
what were you doing at my place?

29:15.880 --> 29:17.760
Your skill in lying

29:17.840 --> 29:19.520
is improving far too quickly.

29:27.440 --> 29:29.720
Though, being
the City Lord, you're so busy

29:29.800 --> 29:31.920
that you don't even have time
to teach your disciples sword skills.

29:32.760 --> 29:34.160
But as a disciple of the Snow City,

29:34.760 --> 29:36.200
protecting the City Lord
is an unshakable duty.

29:36.280 --> 29:37.120
Why be so suspicious?

29:43.320 --> 29:44.520
Stop looking at me like that.

29:52.760 --> 29:53.680
You've got a guilty conscience.

30:05.600 --> 30:06.640
You're right.

30:07.240 --> 30:09.600
I have so many bad things I want to do.

30:13.080 --> 30:14.280
But tonight…

30:16.960 --> 30:19.680
Tonight, I just suddenly
wanted to see you.

30:20.520 --> 30:21.560
Xie Xuechen,

30:22.400 --> 30:23.560
just one day apart,

30:25.400 --> 30:26.280
and I missed you.

30:32.040 --> 30:33.040
Mr. Xie.

30:36.960 --> 30:37.960
Am I beautiful?

30:49.080 --> 30:50.360
All appearances are but illusions,

30:50.920 --> 30:52.160
and in a century, only bones remain.

30:55.600 --> 30:57.040
In your eyes,

30:57.640 --> 30:58.960
people are nothing more

30:59.040 --> 31:01.560
than good or evil, strong or weak.

31:03.640 --> 31:05.320
But do you know, in my eyes,

31:05.920 --> 31:07.480
what's the difference between people?

31:21.000 --> 31:22.240
There's Xie Xuechen,

31:25.000 --> 31:26.280
and then there's everyone else.

31:47.960 --> 31:49.440
Mu Xuanling, how dare you!

31:49.520 --> 31:50.800
In the middle of the night,
instead of staying in your quarter,

31:50.880 --> 31:52.000
you sneak out and even…

31:52.960 --> 31:53.800
disturb the City Lord.

31:54.400 --> 31:55.280
Your reckless behavior

31:55.360 --> 31:57.640
disrupts the City Lord
and your fellow disciples' rest.

31:57.720 --> 31:59.240
You're setting a bad example.

32:00.120 --> 32:00.960
Do you realize your mistake?

32:02.440 --> 32:05.760
Yes, yes. I'll go back
and reflect on my mistake.

32:14.400 --> 32:16.720
Mr. Xie, your bed breaks too easily.

32:16.800 --> 32:18.960
Next time, get a sturdier one.

32:19.800 --> 32:20.960
How dare you!

32:22.080 --> 32:23.040
Mu Xuanling!

32:24.640 --> 32:25.720
You…

32:27.280 --> 32:28.280
Sir,

32:28.920 --> 32:30.200
Xuechen,

32:30.280 --> 32:31.360
you and her…

32:32.000 --> 32:32.960
Oh…

32:36.000 --> 32:37.480
The bed couldn't handle much force.

32:38.240 --> 32:39.520
I really should get a sturdier one.

32:40.160 --> 32:41.600
-I--
-It's getting late.

32:42.320 --> 32:43.360
Elder, please go rest.

32:46.720 --> 32:47.640
Hey…

32:50.560 --> 32:52.080
Senior Daocheng,

32:52.160 --> 32:53.480
the sect has suffered misfortune,

32:53.560 --> 32:54.480
and the Snow City is tarnished.

32:55.400 --> 32:56.760
It's my failure to oversee
everything properly.

32:57.440 --> 32:59.160
My fault entirely.

33:08.360 --> 33:09.480
Your Grace.

33:12.920 --> 33:14.160
What do you think

33:14.680 --> 33:16.360
of the human realm?

33:18.160 --> 33:20.640
The human realm seems
no different from the Dark Abyss.

33:20.720 --> 33:22.360
The strength of their inner demons

33:22.440 --> 33:24.120
surpasses even that

33:24.200 --> 33:25.920
of us Dark Clan.

33:26.520 --> 33:28.440
If even you can sense it,

33:29.880 --> 33:31.760
why can't she see it?

33:32.360 --> 33:34.800
Your Grace, are you
referring to the Saintess?

33:37.560 --> 33:41.200
She has invested far too much
into the human race.

33:45.520 --> 33:46.880
A message from
the Decaying Immortal Pavilion says

33:47.400 --> 33:49.560
Xie Xuechen's spiritual power
has not recovered.

33:50.080 --> 33:52.720
Go to the Snow City
and seize the Chaos Pearl.

33:52.800 --> 33:54.640
Deliver it to me.

33:54.720 --> 33:56.120
If anyone stands in your way,

33:56.880 --> 33:57.920
kill them!

33:58.000 --> 33:58.920
Understood.

34:22.040 --> 34:24.480
Mr. Nan, who's passing you love notes
on a paper crane?

34:25.639 --> 34:27.159
Which young lady is that?

34:27.800 --> 34:31.120
If Feng Yao learns someone
called her a "young lady",

34:31.199 --> 34:32.679
she probably won't be pleased.

34:34.320 --> 34:36.239
I asked Feng Yao to investigate
the Decaying Immortal Pavilion.

34:37.000 --> 34:38.440
After the chaos at the Mirage Palace,

34:38.520 --> 34:40.280
they completely disappeared.

34:41.600 --> 34:42.920
No surprise.

34:43.000 --> 34:44.760
But they've been active
in the human realm,

34:45.480 --> 34:47.760
hiring many from both
the Humans and Spirits.

34:47.840 --> 34:50.360
It seems someone must have noticed them.

34:51.080 --> 34:52.000
Indeed.

34:52.520 --> 34:54.480
Feng Yao found a spirit clansman in a town

34:54.560 --> 34:55.480
near the Jade Sky Palace.

34:56.080 --> 34:58.200
He claimed to have seen members
of the Decaying Immortal Pavilion.

34:58.280 --> 35:02.000
He described the leader
as a young man in his twenties

35:02.080 --> 35:03.960
with exceptional grace.

35:04.560 --> 35:05.600
Another was masked with a black cloth,

35:05.680 --> 35:08.720
but by the voice, it was also a young man.

35:09.320 --> 35:11.040
He addressed the leader as "Master".

35:11.680 --> 35:13.040
Masked with a black cloth…

35:14.280 --> 35:18.040
That clearly shows he doesn't
want his identity known.

35:19.280 --> 35:20.520
Then, why

35:20.600 --> 35:23.240
would the Pavilion Master
show his true face?

35:24.080 --> 35:25.520
Perhaps he's confident in his power.

35:26.120 --> 35:28.040
The Pavilion has operated
for so many years.

35:28.120 --> 35:29.160
Eliminating them completely

35:29.760 --> 35:31.080
won't be an easy task.

35:31.640 --> 35:33.400
The Decaying Immortal Pavilion
is still at large.

35:34.160 --> 35:35.760
By now,

35:35.840 --> 35:36.840
Sang Qi should be out of seclusion.

35:37.760 --> 35:40.320
What will his next move be?

35:49.200 --> 35:50.480
I sense the presence of the Dark Clan…

36:08.400 --> 36:10.200
I didn't expect that so many
in the Immortal Alliance

36:10.280 --> 36:12.600
are harboring ignorance.

36:12.680 --> 36:14.080
Very good.

36:19.400 --> 36:21.280
This body is too weak.

36:22.080 --> 36:22.960
It's time

36:23.560 --> 36:25.840
to select another, a better puppet.

36:28.920 --> 36:30.480
Xuanling!

36:30.560 --> 36:31.600
What's wrong, Bao?

36:32.200 --> 36:34.800
There's… There's something scary nearby.

36:34.880 --> 36:36.520
It's just like back when

36:36.600 --> 36:38.080
at Mr. Nan's house.

36:39.000 --> 36:41.200
-The Dark Clan?
-Which direction?

36:41.800 --> 36:43.600
South… Southeast.

36:47.000 --> 36:48.160
Stay here and look after Bao.

36:48.240 --> 36:50.800
She's timid. If she sees the Dark Clan,
she might be scared to death.

36:50.880 --> 36:52.000
I'll go take a look.

36:52.720 --> 36:54.880
-Are you going alone?
-That's enough.

36:57.520 --> 36:59.320
You must have already sensed it.

36:59.400 --> 37:00.440
I'm going to meet Mr. Xie.

37:00.520 --> 37:02.320
Xuan Xin, take the disciples
and set up an array.

37:02.400 --> 37:03.880
Find the Dark Clan and eliminate them.

37:04.600 --> 37:05.680
Understood.

37:21.600 --> 37:23.280
It's been a while,

37:23.360 --> 37:26.000
and our Saintess's killing intent
is as strong as ever.

37:35.040 --> 37:37.320
I wondered who it was,
so ignorant and reckless.

37:37.920 --> 37:40.040
Turns out it's you, Ignorance Demon.

37:40.720 --> 37:42.480
After all these years of fighting,

37:42.560 --> 37:44.280
I've killed you many times.

37:44.880 --> 37:46.200
Get used to it.

37:47.160 --> 37:49.280
His Grace asked me
to deliver a message to you.

37:50.320 --> 37:52.280
Do you forget who you are

37:52.360 --> 37:54.200
from playing the good guy for too long?

37:55.720 --> 37:57.600
You set out with His Grace's mission,

37:58.600 --> 38:00.640
yet you've delayed taking action.

38:00.720 --> 38:02.600
His Grace can't help but suspect…

38:04.480 --> 38:06.280
you have hidden motives.

38:08.280 --> 38:10.640
Since Master has told you everything,

38:11.200 --> 38:12.640
you should know

38:12.720 --> 38:14.080
I have my own plans.

38:14.760 --> 38:15.720
When it comes to my work,

38:16.240 --> 38:18.080
I can't stand anyone meddling,

38:18.680 --> 38:21.640
not even Master.
And you have even less right to.

38:26.320 --> 38:27.600
Stop!

38:31.000 --> 38:32.400
You truly are vile,

38:32.480 --> 38:33.760
daring to harm the innocent!

38:36.840 --> 38:38.280
Miss, please save me!

38:38.880 --> 38:41.840
I discovered her demonic power,
so she wants to kill me to silence me!

38:44.640 --> 38:46.680
Gao Qiumin, are you stupid?

38:46.760 --> 38:48.240
He's possessed by the Dark Clan!

38:48.320 --> 38:50.720
The Snow City has protective barriers.
How could the Dark Clan possibly enter?

38:51.880 --> 38:52.880
Get lost!

38:56.320 --> 38:57.600
I should never
have covered for you before.

38:57.680 --> 39:00.360
Spirit demonic cultivators
are truly no good!

39:08.040 --> 39:10.560
Gao Qiumin,
the Immortal Alliance is full of fools,

39:10.640 --> 39:12.000
and you're their leader!

39:51.480 --> 39:52.520
What are you trying to do?

39:53.040 --> 39:55.160
Gao Qiumin, today,

39:55.240 --> 39:57.160
I'll settle both old
and new grudges with you!

40:12.320 --> 40:14.760
The Xuantian Sect's Curse?
Could the Dark Clan really have invaded?

40:15.800 --> 40:18.000
If that's true,
then I misjudged her earlier.

40:31.720 --> 40:33.680
The Xuantian Sect's Curse…

40:33.760 --> 40:37.480
It seems anyone
who practices demonic power…

40:37.560 --> 40:40.080
cannot escape the Xuantian Sect's Curse…

40:53.160 --> 40:54.200
I found it.

41:22.960 --> 41:24.080
I win.

41:28.200 --> 41:30.000
You killed your own kind,

41:31.240 --> 41:33.640
stepping over their corpses

41:33.720 --> 41:35.160
to reach your current position.

41:36.120 --> 41:37.360
If they didn't die,

41:37.880 --> 41:39.200
then I would have.

41:39.840 --> 41:41.280
If only one can live,

41:42.720 --> 41:44.320
then it has to be me.

41:54.080 --> 41:55.160
Indeed.

41:56.240 --> 41:57.160
Impressive.

42:06.840 --> 42:08.520
TEMPLE OF DIVINE EXECUTION

42:12.320 --> 42:14.000
My dear disciple,

42:14.080 --> 42:15.120
tell me.

42:15.200 --> 42:17.120
After fighting to survive,

42:17.720 --> 42:18.920
what is it you desire?

42:19.960 --> 42:21.160
I want revenge.

42:22.360 --> 42:24.160
They killed the only person in this world

42:24.680 --> 42:25.840
who was kind to me,

42:26.360 --> 42:27.840
the one who gave me warmth!

42:28.800 --> 42:30.000
I want power…

42:33.960 --> 42:36.440
enough to take revenge
on the Immortal Alliance!

42:37.880 --> 42:39.560
I want revenge!

42:44.160 --> 42:46.320
TEMPLE OF DIVINE EXECUTION

42:46.400 --> 42:49.120
Remember, the more pain you endure,

42:49.200 --> 42:50.920
the stronger you'll become.

42:51.960 --> 42:53.000
You've won.

42:53.520 --> 42:55.240
From today onward,

42:55.320 --> 42:57.400
you're no longer just my disciple,

42:57.920 --> 42:59.720
you are also
the Saintess of the Dark Abyss.
